{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05433","headline":"奉和圣制荅张说扈从南出鼠雀谷之作 · 王丘","name":"奉和圣制荅张说扈从南出鼠雀谷之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"襟带三秦接，旗常万乘过。\n阳原淑气早，阴谷沍寒多。\n花缛前茅仗，霜严後殿戈。\n代云开晋岭，江雁入汾河。\n北土分尧俗，南风动舜歌。\n一闻天乐唱，恭逐万人和。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王丘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}